      "content": "idk if i can get an appointment today tho, doctors are so slow and expensive. i just feel like if i wait i'm gonna end up needing much stronger stuff later. like, if i just start the amoxicillin now, wouldn't that at least help kill off whatever is starting? i still have about 5 pills left from the last time.",
